    "en": "The Ashen Knives’ power on Warren often eclipses that of House Malklaith. This hasn’t become a problem yet, since the Governor is more focused on the Core. A recent alliance with the Maelstrom (fencing goods) has filled the Knives’ coffers, and now their sights are set on expanding."
