    "en": "Between the Warden’s excessive spending habits, Dr. Xhu’s gambling problem, and Kreel’s “educating” the prisoners, Isotropa always needs more funds and bodies. The prison spends a lot of time lobbying local planetary Governors to increase sentencing or acquiring “special guests” from factions, and just as much time looking for bribes."
