    "en": "Dorae White (chief executive, industrious, trustworthy workaholic). Kir M’rikk’lik (technical officer, xeno, gadgeteer, experimenter). Nash (operations chief, gruff, overworked). Rip Onister (gate expert, curious, shy, reclusive)."
