    "en": "Cinszo (owner, ambitious, greedy, untrustworthy). Rinsama Kay (chief editor, cynical, demanding, stickler). Ooxoo (xeno, press pool manager, curious). Stacy Weathers (ace reporter, trained spy, always grinning, nose for trouble)."
